<title>USA: Arthur J. Gallagher buys insurer.</title>
<headline>Arthur J. Gallagher buys insurer.</headline>
<dateline>ITASCA, Ill. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arthur J. Gallagher &amp; Co said Friday it acquired insurer Trinder &amp; Norwood Inc for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Trinder &amp; Norwood of White Plains, N.Y., specializes in marine insurance. It now offers commercial property/casualty and risk management insurance services with special emphasis on the transportation industry.</p>
<p>Arthur J. Gallagher is an international insurance brokerage and risk management services firm.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
